course: dictionary
lesson: 14117
title: Miami, a city by the sea
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: Miami is a proper noun. It is the name of one special place, so it always starts with a capital letter. «We flew to Miami for our summer holiday.» Here Miami is the place they flew to, and the capital M shows that it is a name.
explain: The words around a name give clues about the place. «Miami is hot and sunny for most of the year, with long beaches by the sea.» These clues tell you Miami is warm and close to the coast, near the Caribbean.
explain: Clues can also show you what a place is like when the weather is bad. «Miami is often hit by hurricanes, so people there learn hurricane safety.» A hurricane is a huge, violent storm, so families in Miami learn what to do when one comes.
explain: Be careful not to mix up places with similar names. «Miami Beach is a separate city next to Miami.» Miami Beach has its own name, even though it sits right beside Miami.
fact: Miami is a proper noun, so it always starts with a capital letter.
fact: Miami is a large city in the state of Florida, in the south-east of the USA.
fact: Miami is famous for its beaches, warm weather and Latin American culture.
fact: Many people in Miami speak Spanish as well as English.
fact: Miami Beach is a separate city next to Miami.
exercise: «We flew to Miami for our summer holiday.» What kind of word is Miami? | A verb, a doing word | A plural noun | An adjective, a describing word | *A proper noun, the name of a place
exercise: What state is Miami in? | California | *Florida | New York | Texas
exercise: «Miami is often hit by hurricanes, so people there learn hurricane safety.» What is a hurricane? | A gentle breeze on a quiet beach | A type of sandwich | A cold, foggy morning | *A huge, violent storm
test: «Miami is hot, sunny and close to the sea.» Which clue tells you Miami is near water? | *Beaches | Sunny | Big | Hot
test: Why does Miami start with a capital letter? | Because it is a very long word | Because it begins every sentence | *Because it is the name of one particular place | Because it is a doing word
exam: Which statement is true? | Miami is a beach in Canada | Miami is a type of hurricane | *Miami is a city in Florida, and Miami Beach is a separate city next to it | Miami is a country in Europe
